@startuml
title Student Sequence Diagram

participant ":Student" as Student
participant ":System" as System
participant ":Database" as Database

Student -> System : Login(credentials)
System -> Database : Verify Credentials
Database --> System : Valid
System --> Student : Login Successful

Student -> System : Request Live Menu
System -> Database : Fetch Menu
Database --> System : Menu Data
System --> Student : Display Live Menu

Student -> System : Pre-book Meal
System --> Student : Show Customization Options

Student -> System : Customize Meal
Student -> System : Select Portion Size

System -> Database : Save Booking
Database --> System : Booking Saved
System --> Student : Booking Confirmation

System --> Student : Send Real-Time Notification

Student -> System : View My Bookings
System -> Database : Fetch Booking Details
Database --> System : Booking Data
System --> Student : Display Bookings

Student -> System : Submit Feedback
System -> Database : Store Feedback
Database --> System : Feedback Saved
System --> Student : Feedback Submitted

Student -> System : Logout
System --> Student : Logged Out Successfully

destroy Student

@enduml